        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 6.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Newaliki Yesu ajoki, “Etejoki, ‘Mitem iyie Olaitoriani Enkai ino.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee emitunye shetani too ntemat enyena pooki nelo aing'uaa eanyu ai rishata enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eiterua Yesu alikioo lomon te Galilaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nerrinyo Yesu Galilaya ebore engolon e Nkiyang'et Sinyati, neibulaa enkisisa, nkuapi naamanita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiteng'enisho too nkajijik enye e ntumo nerrep iltung'ana pooki ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etanyaki Yesu te Nasaret",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neito ninye Nasaret ine netubulaka, nejing enkaji e ntumo te nkolong e nkiyeng'iyeng'ata, anaa enaiko apake, neitashe aisoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishori embuku o loiboni le Nkai Isaya. Nebol ina buku netum ewueji netisiraki aajo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiken embuku, neshukoki olashumani neton; neibelekenya lelo pooki ootoni te nkaji e ntumo aaing'or ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiter ajoki ninche, “Eitabayioki taata kulo sirat ining'itoto too nkiyiaa inyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neimaki pooki ninye aarrep eing'asia too rorei le mpiris ooimu enkutuk enye. Nejo, “Ae mme olayioni le Yosef doi ele?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye ninche, “Meeta nchere pee eitu kiyookiki aadung'ie rashe aajoki, ‘Olabaani tabaa kewan,’ nijojo, ‘Taasa sii iyie te ine nitubulaka, mbaa nijo nena nikitoning'o nchere itaasa te Kapernaum.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.4.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yhn 4.44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejo, “Esipa ajoki intae, meetae oloiboni le Nkai oyanyiti te murua nabulaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 17.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Esipa nchere keetae apa nkolia kumok ti atua Siraeli te nkata o loiboni Eliya, pee elai enchan too larin okuni o lapaitin ile, neibulu olameyu ina kop pooki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
