          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12+1CH.17.13+1CH.17.14+1CH.17.15+1CH.17.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 17.8-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kake ore eyia, eitu eirriwakini Eliya hoo nabo e nena, enkoliai e Sarepta ake eirriwakaki te nkop e Sidon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.5.1+2CH.5.2+2CH.5.3+2CH.5.4+2CH.5.5+2CH.5.6+2CH.5.7+2CH.5.8+2CH.5.9+2CH.5.10+2CH.5.11+2CH.5.12+2CH.5.13+2CH.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 5.1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kumok sii iltung'ana le nkeeya oo lbolot oatae te Siraeli te nkata o loiboni le Nkai Elisha, nemeetae hoo likae obo oitukuoki, leme Naaman ake le Siria.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ening nena baa pooki etoni ti atua enkaji e ntumo neiput engoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinyototo, nearaa auluo e ina anasa neriku embata e marti namanya ina anasa, ejo pee esulaa te ina marti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake etapaashare apolos atua ninche nelo ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oltung'ani oata oloirirua oiduruk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedou alotu Kapernaum, aa enkanasa e Galilaya, neiteng'en ninche te nkolong e nkiyeng'iyeng'ata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.7.28+MAT.7.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 7.28-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neing'asia te nkiteng'enare enye, amu keiro anaa oloata enkitoria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii atua ina aji e ntumo oltung'ani oata oloirirua oiduruk. Nebuak aishir to ltoilo sapuk ejo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ooi Yesu le Nasaret, ainyoo iatakinore iyiook? Iyewuo aidaikie iyiook? Kaayiolo ajo ira ng'ae: ira ilo obo Sinyati le Nkai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisikong Yesu nejoki, “Tigirayu! Tupuku tung'uai ninye.” Nebatat ilo oirirua torrono te dukuya ninye nepuku aing'uaa meeta enaitaasa ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neing'asia pooki nejokino, “Kaa kiroroto ena nairo? Aaku kearaa te nkitoria o te ngolon iloiriruani ooiduruk, nepuku ninche.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neibulu enkisisa enye pooki wueji te nena murua naamanita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishiunye Yesu ltung'ana kumok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee eing'uaa enkaji e ntumo nejing enkaji e Simon. Neitirrishaka olkirobi enkaputani e Simon, neikilikuani enkaraki ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitashe arumaki ninye kop nearaa ilo kirobi, nepuku olkirobi aing'uaa. Neinyototo nabo kata aisiaai ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore edoyio enkolong, neyau lelo pooki ooata ltamueyia loo mpukunot kumok aayaki ninye meishiunye. Neiteleiki ake pooki tung'ani nkaik neishiunye ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuku sii iloiriruani ooiduruk kumok, aaing'uaa ltung'ana ebuaaya aajo, “Ira iyie Enkerai e Nkai.” Neing'ode amitiki eiro, amu keyiolo ninche aajo Kristo ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etolikioyie Yesu ororei te Yudea",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ekenyu nelo ewueji neliyio; kake eing'oru olorere ninye. Nepuonu enetii, nejo maiboo neing'uaa ninche; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake etiaaka ninche, “Kalo ake pee aliki sii ninche kulie ang'itie kulo omon supati le nkitoria e Nkai. Ina pee aairriwuaki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelikioo lelo omon too nkajijik e ntumo e Yudea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
